---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const meta = {
  title: 'Donate | Support the Sunbright Recovery Mission',
  description:
    'Your gift helps open doors for people who need recovery. Support Sunbright Recovery Center, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit serving Northern California.',
  primaryKeyword: 'donate to addiction recovery',
};

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Donate', url: '/donate' },
];
---

<SiteLayout {...meta} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap ph-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Support Our Mission</span>
      <h1>Your gift opens a door <em>someone else can't.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Sunbright Recovery Center is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit built on a simple belief: that where you were born, how much money you have, and what insurance card you carry should not determine whether you get to recover. Your donation helps make that belief real.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="tel:+15305282342" class="btn btn-gold">Call (530) 528-2342</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Contact Us to Give</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose wide">
        <p>Most residential rehabs in California are owned by national chains charging $30,000 or more a month to maximize shareholder returns. Sunbright is different. As a <strong>501(c)(3) nonprofit</strong>, every dollar — from program fees, donations, and grants — goes back into care. Not profits. Not investors. Care.</p>
        <p>That difference is meaningful. It means our decisions are driven by clinical need, not quarterly targets. It means we answer to a board and to the community — not to Wall Street or private equity. And it means that gifts like yours can directly expand access to people who would otherwise have no path to treatment.</p>

        <h2>Where every dollar goes</h2>
        <p>When you give to Sunbright, you are giving to the work itself. Donations support:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Opening doors for people who can't afford care.</strong> We are actively working to build a scholarship fund so that cost is never the reason someone can't start recovery.</li>
          <li><strong>Furnishing and equipping the center.</strong> From comfortable residential rooms to group therapy spaces and the chapel, the physical environment matters — and gifts help us maintain and improve it.</li>
          <li><strong>Clinical staffing and programming.</strong> The human side of recovery — skilled counselors, evidence-based curricula, and faith-integrated support — is the most important investment we make.</li>
          <li><strong>Community and aftercare programs.</strong> Recovery doesn't end on day 30 or day 90. Gifts help us sustain the follow-on support that keeps people well after they leave residential care.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Built differently — and that matters</h2>
        <p>When you donate to a for-profit treatment company, your gift improves someone's investment return. When you donate to Sunbright, your gift improves someone's life. The structure of a nonprofit is not a technicality — it is a commitment. Every financial decision we make is governed by mission, not margin.</p>

        <div class="callout">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
          <p><strong>Tax-deductible giving:</strong> Sunbright Recovery Center is a registered 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization. Your contribution is tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law. Please consult your tax advisor for guidance specific to your situation.</p>
        </div>

        <h2>How to give</h2>
        <p>We are in the process of setting up a secure online giving portal. In the meantime, the easiest ways to make a gift are:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Call us</strong> at <a href="tel:+15305282342">(530) 528-2342</a> and a team member will walk you through the options.</li>
          <li><strong>Send a message</strong> through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> and we will respond within one business day with giving instructions.</li>
          <li><strong>Mail a check</strong> to Sunbright Recovery Center, 22425 Sunbright Ave, Red Bluff, CA 96080. Please include your name and contact information so we can acknowledge your gift.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>For questions about major gifts, sponsorships, or in-kind donations, please reach out directly. We are grateful for every expression of support — at every level.</p>

        <h2>Other ways to help</h2>
        <p>Financial gifts are one way to make a difference. If you want to give your time, skills, or connections instead — or in addition — visit our <a href="/get-involved">Get Involved page</a> to learn about volunteering, space sponsorships, and community partnerships. And if you want to understand the organization behind the mission, our <a href="/about">About page</a> tells the full story.</p>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside">
        <h3>Why give to Sunbright</h3>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          501(c)(3) registered nonprofit
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Every dollar goes to care — not investors
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Community-accountable board governance
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Serving Tehama County &amp; Northern California
        </div>
        <a href="tel:+15305282342" class="btn btn-gold">Call to Give — (530) 528-2342</a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-navy" style="margin-top:10px">Send Us a Message</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="stats" style="justify-content:center">
        <div class="stat" style="text-align:center"><div class="num">100%</div><div class="lbl">Nonprofit — every dollar to care</div></div>
        <div class="stat" style="text-align:center"><div class="num">16</div><div class="lbl">Residential beds to fill with support</div></div>
        <div class="stat" style="text-align:center"><div class="num">501(c)(3)</div><div class="lbl">Tax-deductible organization</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Three pillars of giving</span>
        <h2>What your support <em>makes possible</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.318 6.318a4.5 4.5 0 000 6.364L12 20.364l7.682-7.682a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364-6.364L12 7.636l-1.318-1.318a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.364 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Real care, not revenue targets</h3>
          <p>No upselling, no surprise charges, no quarterly earnings calls. Your gift funds one goal and one goal only: recovery. Every clinical decision is driven by what the person in front of us needs — not what generates the best margin.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Donations are tax-deductible</h3>
          <p>Every contribution helps someone heal — and qualifies as a tax-deductible gift to a registered 501(c)(3). Your generosity goes further when it also works in your favor come tax season.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Community-accountable</h3>
          <p>Governed by a board, answerable to the people we serve — not Wall Street, not private equity. When you give to Sunbright, you are investing in a Northern California institution that belongs to this community.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <span class="eyebrow">Make a difference today</span>
    <h2>Recovery is possible. <em>Your gift helps prove it.</em></h2>
    <p>Call us or send a message to make your gift. Our team will walk you through the giving process personally and send you a gift acknowledgment for your records.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="tel:+15305282342" class="btn btn-gold">Call (530) 528-2342</a>
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-ghost">Contact Us to Give</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
